# The pipeline uses only free, keyless data sources — Wikipedia, Billboard Hot
# 100, World Bank, and Open Trivia DB. NO API KEY IS REQUIRED; you don't need a
# .env file at all to build a real edition.
#
# The LLM aggregator modules (src/hlq/fetch/gemini.py, groq.py) are kept for
# reference but are NOT wired into the default pipeline — free-tier LLM web
# search proved unusable (Gemini grounding needs billing; Groq Compound hits
# 413/TPM). Reviving one would mean restoring the dispatch in aggregate.py and
# adding the relevant key here.
